{"page":201,"verses":[{"verse_key":"9:87","surah":9,"ayah":87,"ar_uthmani":"رَضُوا۟ بِأَن يَكُونُوا۟ مَعَ ٱلْخَوَالِفِ وَطُبِعَ عَلَىٰ قُلُوبِهِمْ فَهُمْ لَا يَفْقَهُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"they prefer to be with those who stay behind. Their hearts have been sealed: they do not comprehend.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"رَضُوا۟","en_gloss":"They (were) satisfied","transliteration":"raḍū","verse_key":"9:87"},{"pos":2,"ar":"بِأَن","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"bi-an","verse_key":"9:87"},{"pos":3,"ar":"يَكُونُوا۟","en_gloss":"be","transliteration":"yakūnū","verse_key":"9:87"},{"pos":4,"ar":"مَعَ","en_gloss":"with","transliteration":"maʿa","verse_key":"9:87"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلْخَوَالِفِ","en_gloss":"those who stay behind","transliteration":"l-khawālifi","verse_key":"9:87"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَطُبِعَ","en_gloss":"and were sealed","transliteration":"waṭubiʿa","verse_key":"9:87"},{"pos":7,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"[on]","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"9:87"},{"pos":8,"ar":"قُلُوبِهِمْ","en_gloss":"their hearts","transliteration":"qulūbihim","verse_key":"9:87"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فَهُمْ","en_gloss":"so they","transliteration":"fahum","verse_key":"9:87"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"9:87"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يَفْقَهُونَ","en_gloss":"understand","transliteration":"yafqahūna","verse_key":"9:87"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٨٧","en_gloss":"(87)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:87"}]},{"verse_key":"9:88","surah":9,"ayah":88,"ar_uthmani":"لَـٰكِنِ ٱلرَّسُولُ وَٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ مَعَهُۥ جَـٰهَدُوا۟ بِأَمْوَٰلِهِمْ وَأَنفُسِهِمْ ۚ وَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ لَهُمُ ٱلْخَيْرَٰتُ ۖ وَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ هُمُ ٱلْمُفْلِحُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"But the Messenger and those who believe with him strive hard with their possessions and their persons. The best things belong to them; it is they who will prosper.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لَـٰكِنِ","en_gloss":"But","transliteration":"lākini","verse_key":"9:88"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلرَّسُولُ","en_gloss":"the Messenger","transliteration":"l-rasūlu","verse_key":"9:88"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"and those who","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","verse_key":"9:88"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"believed","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"9:88"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مَعَهُۥ","en_gloss":"with him","transliteration":"maʿahu","verse_key":"9:88"},{"pos":6,"ar":"جَـٰهَدُوا۟","en_gloss":"strove","transliteration":"jāhadū","verse_key":"9:88"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بِأَمْوَٰلِهِمْ","en_gloss":"with their wealth","transliteration":"bi-amwālihim","verse_key":"9:88"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَأَنفُسِهِمْ ۚ","en_gloss":"and their lives","transliteration":"wa-anfusihim","verse_key":"9:88"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","en_gloss":"And those","transliteration":"wa-ulāika","verse_key":"9:88"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَهُمُ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahumu","verse_key":"9:88"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱلْخَيْرَٰتُ ۖ","en_gloss":"(are) the good things","transliteration":"l-khayrātu","verse_key":"9:88"},{"pos":12,"ar":"وَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ","en_gloss":"and those ","transliteration":"wa-ulāika","verse_key":"9:88"},{"pos":13,"ar":"هُمُ","en_gloss":"they","transliteration":"humu","verse_key":"9:88"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلْمُفْلِحُونَ","en_gloss":"(are) the successful ones","transliteration":"l-muf'liḥūna","verse_key":"9:88"},{"pos":15,"ar":"٨٨","en_gloss":"(88)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:88"}]},{"verse_key":"9:89","surah":9,"ayah":89,"ar_uthmani":"أَعَدَّ ٱللَّهُ لَهُمْ جَنَّـٰتٍ تَجْرِى مِن تَحْتِهَا ٱلْأَنْهَـٰرُ خَـٰلِدِينَ فِيهَا ۚ ذَٰلِكَ ٱلْفَوْزُ ٱلْعَظِيمُ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"God has prepared Gardens graced with flowing streams for them and there they will stay. That is the supreme triumph.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَعَدَّ","en_gloss":"Allah has prepared","transliteration":"aʿadda","verse_key":"9:89"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah has prepared","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"9:89"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en_gloss":"for them","transliteration":"lahum