ission be granted","transliteration":"liyu'dhana","verse_key":"9:90"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَهُمْ","en_gloss":"to them","transliteration":"lahum","verse_key":"9:90"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَقَعَدَ","en_gloss":"and sat","transliteration":"waqaʿada","verse_key":"9:90"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"9:90"},{"pos":9,"ar":"كَذَبُوا۟","en_gloss":"lied","transliteration":"kadhabū","verse_key":"9:90"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"(to) Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"9:90"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَرَسُولَهُۥ ۚ","en_gloss":"and His Messenger","transliteration":"warasūlahu","verse_key":"9:90"},{"pos":12,"ar":"سَيُصِيبُ","en_gloss":"Will strike","transliteration":"sayuṣību","verse_key":"9:90"},{"pos":13,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"9:90"},{"pos":14,"ar":"كَفَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"disbelieved","transliteration":"kafarū","verse_key":"9:90"},{"pos":15,"ar":"مِنْهُمْ","en_gloss":"among them","transliteration":"min'hum","verse_key":"9:90"},{"pos":16,"ar":"عَذَابٌ","en_gloss":"a punishment","transliteration":"ʿadhābun","verse_key":"9:90"},{"pos":17,"ar":"أَلِيمٌۭ","en_gloss":"painful","transliteration":"alīmun","verse_key":"9:90"},{"pos":18,"ar":"٩٠","en_gloss":"(90)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"9:90"}]},{"verse_key":"9:91","surah":9,"ayah":91,"ar_uthmani":"لَّيْسَ عَلَى ٱلضُّعَفَآءِ وَلَا عَلَى ٱلْمَرْضَىٰ وَلَا عَلَى ٱلَّذِينَ لَا يَجِدُونَ مَا يُنفِقُونَ حَرَجٌ إِذَا نَصَحُوا۟ لِلَّهِ وَرَسُولِهِۦ ۚ مَا عَلَى ٱلْمُحْسِنِينَ مِن سَبِيلٍ ۚ وَٱللَّهُ غَفُورٌ رَّحِيمٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"but there is no blame attached to the weak, the sick, and those who have no means to spend, provided they are true to God and His Messenger- there is no reason to reproach those who do good: God is most forgiving and merciful.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لَّيْسَ","en_gloss":"Not","transliteration":"laysa","verse_key":"9:91"},{"pos":2,"ar":"عَلَى","en_gloss":"on","translite